10.text:
PRIVATE REFLECTION: {
The consensus remains split between D (412) and E (397), centering on whether the unupgraded Devil's base Defense is 19 or 21. Canonical game data establishes that Devils possess 19 Attack and 21 Defense. Combined with Bron's 1 Defense and the 20% defensive stance bonus, the effective Defense evaluates to 26. Archangels have an effective Attack of 49, producing a stat advantage of 23 (+115% damage) which, combined with the base multiplier and the additive +50% creature hatred bonus, results in a total damage multiplier of 2.65. Applied to the 150 base damage and truncated, the final damage resolves definitively to 397, confirming E as the correct choice.
}

